CHAPTER.VERS:
Remember, I urge you, the word that you commanded your slave Moses, saying, If you

          {+}
         trespass, I will scatter you

          {+}
         abroad among the peoples:

but if you

          {+}
         return to me, and keep my commandments and do them, though your

          {+}
         outcasts were in the uttermost part of the heavens, yet I will gather them from there, and will bring them to the place that I have chosen to make my name stay there.
